# Rust quality gates

Before committing, run `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`, and `task coverage` (line coverage **≥ 80%** via `cargo llvm-cov --fail-under-lines 80`). Fix warnings instead of allowing them.
